ll is a large-scale digital display that responds to touch, gestures, or motion. Our systems use a combination of projection mapping, touch sensors, or camera-based tracking to detect user input and display dynamic content. They're perfect for corporate lobbies, museums, retail spaces, and event activations.",relatedService:"Interactive Display Walls",serviceSlug:"interactive-display-walls"},{question:"How much does a custom interactive installation cost?",answer:"Interactive installations typically range from $50,000 to $500,000+ depending on scale, complexity, and custom software requirements. We provide turn-key solutions that include hardware, software development, content creation, installation, and ongoing support. Contact us for a detailed quote based on your specific needs.",relatedService:"Interactive Display Walls",serviceSlug:"interactive-display-walls"},{question:"What industries do you work with?",answer:"We work across healthcare, corporate, education, sports and entertainment, hospitality, museums, and retail. Our clients include hospitals, universities, Fortune 500 companies, professional sports teams, and cultural institutions worldwide."},{question:"Do you provide AR/VR experiences?",answer:"Yes, we design and develop augmented reality (AR) and virtual reality (VR) experiences for various applications including training simulations, interactive exhibits, virtual tours, and immersive brand activations. Our team combines hardware expertise with custom software development.",relatedService:"Immersive Environments",serviceSlug:"immersive-environments"},{question:"What is a donor recognition wall?",answer:"A donor recognition wall is a digital display system that honors contributors, donors, and supporters with dynamic, updateable content. Unlike traditional plaques, our digital recognition walls can feature photos, videos, searchable databases, and interactive storytelling elements that grow with your organization.",relatedService:"Recognition & Legacy Walls",serviceSlug:"recognition-legacy-walls"},{question:"Can you integrate with our existing systems?",answer:"Absolutely. Our solutions are designed to integrate with existing CMS platforms, CRM systems, data feeds, building management systems, and third-party APIs. We ensure seamless data flow and content management across your technology ecosystem."},{question:"What is the typical project timeline?",answer:"Project timelines vary based on complexity. Simple digital signage installations may take 4-6 weeks, while custom interactive experiences typically require 3-6 months from concept to installation. Large-scale immersive environments may take 6-12 months. We provide detailed project schedules during the proposal phase."},{question:"Do you offer maintenance and support?",answer:"Yes, we provide comprehensive support packages including remote monitoring, software updates, content management, hardware maintenance, and 24/7 emergency support. Our team ensures your installation continues to perform optimally long after launch."}],cJe=e=>({"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage",mainEntity:e.map(t=>({"@type":"Question",name:t.question,acceptedAnswer:{"@type":"Answer",text:t.answer}}))}),dJe=()=>{const e=E.useRef(null),t=Wy(e,{once:!0,amount:.1});return r.jsxs("section",{ref:e,id:"faq",className:"py-24 md:py-32 relative overflow-hidden",children:[r.jsx("script",{type:"application/ld+json",dangerouslySetInnerHTML:{__html:JSON.stringify(cJe(xve))}}),r.jsx("div",{className:"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-background via-secondary/10 to-background"}),r.jsx("div",{className:"absolute top-1/4 right-1/4 w-[500px] h-[500px] rounded-full blur-[180px] opacity-20",style:{background:"radial-gradient(circle, hsl(var(--primary)/0.15), transparent 70%)"}}),r.jsxs("div",{className:"container mx-auto px-6 relative z-10",children:[r.jsxs(lt.div,{className:"max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16",initial:{opacity:0,y:30},animate:t?{opacity:1,y:0}:{},transition:{duration:.